        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this (fairly short) <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong>, you guide <strong>Yvette</strong> through her daily life in her apartment. She's been living alone for some time now and she's noticing some strange details. <strong>Explore</strong> <strong>the locations</strong> with Yvette and lose track of time and space with her. Despite her isolation, you'll encounter several <strong>NPC</strong>s throughout the game who enrich the world around Yvette and provide information that she couldn't have discovered on her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.poster.avif?t=1757520021\" width=444 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.webm?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.mp4?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll solve some <strong>not-too-complicated puzzles</strong> and discover more about the story every day. Another gameplay aspect is your <strong>own decision-making</strong>, whether it is in dialogue or elsewhere, which influences the plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains <strong>mild horror elements</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this (fairly short) <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong>, you guide <strong>Yvette</strong> through her daily life in her apartment. She's been living alone for some time now and she's noticing some strange details. <strong>Explore</strong> <strong>the locations</strong> with Yvette and lose track of time and space with her. Despite her isolation, you'll encounter several <strong>NPC</strong>s throughout the game who enrich the world around Yvette and provide information that she couldn't have discovered on her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.poster.avif?t=1757520021\" width=444 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.webm?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.mp4?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll solve some <strong>not-too-complicated puzzles</strong> and discover more about the story every day. Another gameplay aspect is your <strong>own decision-making</strong>, whether it is in dialogue or elsewhere, which influences the plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains <strong>mild horror elements</strong>.</p>",
